        </h2><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">1</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Fellow Stagg EKG</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span</div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Fellow Stagg EKG是2026年最具设计感的电水壶。其经典的鹅颈壶嘴设计最初为手冲咖啡而生，水流控制精准。内置精确温度计实时显示水温，0.5度精度。记忆功能可记住常用温度设置。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg</div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">在亚马逊上查看价格 →</a></div>
<div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">2</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Breville BKE820</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span</div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Breville BKE820采用独特的Soft Close机制——轻轻按压壶盖即可缓降关闭。5档预设温度（70/80/85/90/100度）满足不同类型茶叶需求。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg</div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">在亚马逊上查看价格 →</a></div>
<div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">3</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Cuisinart CPB-300</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span</div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Cuisinart PerfecTemp是入门级精控温水壶的标杆。6档预设温度覆盖所有常见需求，45分钟保温功能让热水随时可用。价格在同类产品中极具竞争力。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg</div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gol